        ("    - question_subsection_overmerge_risk\n    - strong_claim_without_declared_evidence_scope\n", "    - question_subsection_overmerge_risk\n    - heading_overframed_without_navigation_gain\n    - strong_claim_without_declared_evidence_scope\n"),
        ("    - question_subsection_overmerge_risk\n    - heading_overframed_without_navigation_gain\n", "    - question_subsection_overmerge_risk\n    - heading_parent_context_repetition\n    - heading_overframed_without_navigation_gain\n"),
        ("      - solver_precondition_missing_for_declared_dependency\n      - subsection_overmerged_despite_independent_tasks\n", "      - solver_precondition_missing_for_declared_dependency\n      - generic_heading_density\n      - subsection_overmerged_despite_independent_tasks\n"),
        ("      - generic_heading_density\n      - subsection_overmerged_despite_independent_tasks\n", "      - generic_heading_density\n      - heading_overframed_without_navigation_gain\n      - subsection_overmerged_despite_independent_tasks\n"),
        ("      - generic_heading_density\n      - heading_overframed_without_navigation_gain\n", "      - generic_heading_density\n      - heading_parent_context_repetition\n      - heading_overframed_without_navigation_gain\n"),
        ("  result_third_level_rule: 模型求解结果与分析按 Paper Writing Protocol §2.2 使用三级标题，不把主要结果解释推迟到模型检验。\n", "  result_third_level_rule: >-\n    模型求解结果与分析允许在存在多个独立结果任务、不同方案或可单独回指的核心解释时设置三级标题；\n    只有一张普通结果图或单个数值时不因此独立设标题，不把结果解释全部推迟到模型检验。\n  review_triggers:\n    - more_than_four_second_level_subsections_without_independent_argument_need\n    - subsection_contains_only_one_formula_table_or_figure\n    - adjacent_subsections_form_one_unbroken_argument_chain\n    - decision_variables_objective_constraints_summary_split_mechanically\n    - long_model_section_contains_multiple_independent_tasks_but_no_navigation_anchor\n    - boundary_ablation_independent_challenge_each_split_despite_same_validation_role\n  merge_preferences:\n    - thin_decision_variables_objective_constraints_and_summary -> model_construction\n    - active_boundary_and_solver_refinement -> model_solution_or_validation\n    - ablation_independent_algorithm_challenge_local_neighborhood -> result_analysis_or_validation_when_same_claim\n  separation_preferences:\n    - independent_key_predicate_or_proof -> short_local_heading\n    - independent_structural_reduction -> short_local_heading_when_navigation_improves\n    - independent_parameter_evidence -> short_local_heading_when_result_is_reused\n    - independent_solver_stage -> short_local_heading_when_control_or_search_role_differs\n"),
        ("    rules:\n      - 小节组织见 Paper Writing Protocol §2、§3.1。\n      - 不为小节对称或版式整齐新增不存在的数学任务。\n", "    rules:\n      - 不按合同字段机械拆分同一条论证链。\n      - 单一公式、普通图表、单个参数或标准算法参数设置本身不足以自动形成独立标题。\n      - 三级标题是正常可用的正式导航层级；二级小节内只要存在需要独立定位的数学任务、命题/关键算法/关键图锚点，或拆分能明显提升长论证可恢复性即可使用；不要求先满足“两个以上”配额，也不因三级标题数量较多自动否决。\n      - 不为小节对称或版式整齐新增不存在的数学任务。\n      - 复杂模型若确有多个独立任务，允许使用“短而明确”的三级标题；不得为了压缩标题数把证明、关键约束与参数证据混在一个难以回指的长段中。\n"),
        ("    adaptive_separation:\n      authority: Paper Writing Protocol §2.2\n", "    adaptive_separation:\n      separate_when_any:\n        - independent_formula_group_or_nontrivial_definition\n        - independent_proposition_or_key_predicate\n        - independent_structural_reduction\n        - independent_numerical_parameter_evidence\n        - independent_solver_stage\n        - independent_result_task_with_distinct_answer_or_interpretation\n        - downstream_text_requires_clear_local_anchor\n        - merged_long_argument_would_reduce_recoverability\n      keep_continuous_when_all:\n        - same_argument_chain\n        - each_candidate_heading_has_little_independent_content\n        - no_downstream_anchor_need\n      optimization_profiles:\n        compact: model_construction_continuous_prose_then_solution_then_result\n        navigational: decision_variables_or_objective_or_key_constraints_or_summary_may_have_short_subheadings_when_independent\n      rule: >-\n        不把“减少标题”或“增加导航”任一方向设为默认审美；是否拆分由独立数学任务和恢复性决定，而不是由字数、标题数量或版面对称决定。\n"),
        ("    third_level_judge_readability:\n      governance_level: default\n      authority: Paper Writing Protocol §2.1\n", "    third_level_judge_readability:\n      scope: CUMCM_question_tertiary_headings_under_functional_second_level\n      governance_level: default\n      reader_assumption: mathematical_modeling_literate_not_domain_specialist\n      priority: task_recoverability_before_jargon_display_or_shortest_wording\n      selection_sequence:\n        - decide_whether_an_independent_mathematical_task_needs_a_third_level_heading\n        - locate_the_second_level_functional_role\n        - identify_concrete_object_and_mathematical_task\n        - retain_necessary_scope_output_or_distinguishing_method\n        - apply_judge_readability_then_heading_compression\n        - check_mathematical_accuracy_and_adjacent_heading_distinction\n      judge_readability_question: >-\n        非题目专业领域的数学建模评委看到三级标题，能否恢复对象是什么、\n        实际完成什么计算/判断，或者得到什么答案？不能时先补对象与数学任务，\n        再把非必需的算法缩写、机理名称放在正文。\n      necessary_terminology_exception: >-\n        KKT、Sobol、Pareto 等术语如确为区分研究对象、关键方法或准确数学结论所必需，\n        允许保留必要限定；不能为了“通俗”改成“数据处理”“模型处理”“结果说明”等空泛标题。\n      title_compression_order: >-\n        先说明对象、任务与必要限定，后删除“基于……的……研究”“在……视角下”等装饰；\n        不对首选二级标题运行三级任务型改名，不设字数/术语表/数量配额。\n      examples:\n        - original: FV-BDF-Radau 一致性\n          preferred: 状态方程求解结果的一致性检验\n          condition: 实际检查的是该方程不同数值方案输出的一致性\n        - original: Sobol 全局敏感性分解\n          preferred: 关键参数对最终结果的影响\n          condition: 实际计算并验收了相应输出指标的参数影响\n        - original: Pareto 前沿结构分析\n          preferred: 不同方案的成本与效果比较\n          condition: 实际有可比较的成本/效果指标且不夸大最优性\n        - original: 数据处理\n          preferred: 观测时间的统一\n          condition: 真实工作是将多源观测时间统一\n      accuracy_boundary: >-\n        示例不是自动术语替换表；仅概括已批准模型和 current 证据支持的实际任务，\n        不能以易读为由删除核心推导、改变数值/模型含义或制造未执行的实验。\n      machine_audit_scope:\n        may_review:\n          - tertiary_jargon_without_object_or_task\n          - tertiary_generic_heading_without_specific_task\n          - tertiary_necessary_mathematical_distinction_lost\n        must_not_claim:\n          - judge_understanding_from_title_length_or_keyword_only\n          - task_correctness_without_reading_actual_model_and_evidence\n"),
        ("        不把主要结果解释挪到 VALIDATE。", "        不把主要结果解释挪到 VALIDATE，也不因结果图表多就机械拆分三级标题。"),
        ("        result: 先给出直接答案与决定性图表数值，再就地解释其题意。", "        result: 先给出直接答案与决定性图表数值，再就地解释其题意；允许按独立结果任务使用三级标题。"),
        ("      heading_choice_rule: 见 Paper Writing Protocol §3.1。\n", "      heading_choice_rule: >-\n        复杂问题优先按 MODEL→SOLVE→RESULT→可选 VALIDATE 组织，\n        正常情况保持 heading_by_role 的首选二级标题及顺序，不因三级标题任务化、术语压缩或\n        父标题重复而任意改名；XX 填入数学准确且易识别的模型对象。\n        只有 documented_exception_categories 对应的条件成立并能解释事实依据时，\n        才不要求使用完全相同字面标题；简单题可合并确实不存在的薄槽，\n        不得掩盖真实的关键推导、结果和检验。\n"),
        ("      normal_title_preservation: 见 Paper Writing Protocol §3.1。\n", "      normal_title_preservation: >-\n        CUMCM 复杂问在 MODEL/SOLVE/RESULT 真实独立时优先保留“XX模型的建立”、\n        “模型求解”“模型求解结果与分析”的原文和顺序；\n        第四节仅在有独立有效检验或对照时出现。二级标题说明环节，三级标题说明具体数学任务。\n      non_arbitrary_rename_rule: >-\n        不能因为标题简短、父标题已有“建立及求解”、作者希望展示算法名，\n        就把“模型求解”改为算法名、把“模型求解结果与分析”拆成普通二级结果与分析；\n        XX 使用读者可识别的模型对象/类型，不能堆砌专业术语。\n      documented_exception_categories:\n        - simple_analytic_or_direct_computation_no_independent_solve\n        - inherited_or_compact_question_with_only_genuine_increment\n        - multiple_independent_models_not_recoverable_under_single_default_profile\n        - official_template_or_actual_math_dependency_conflict\n      exception_trace_rule: >-\n        发生例外时记录具体数学/模板事实、默认标题为何不能准确导航以及如何保留真实功能；\n        不因为四节形式而虚构算法、模型检验、替代方法对照或额外证据。\n"),
        ("    heading_basis: Paper Writing Protocol §2–3.1\n", "    heading_basis:\n      - independent_mathematical_task\n      - independent_solution_stage\n      - independent_result_or_validation_role\n"),
        ("  professional_heading_semantics:\n    governance_level: default\n    authority: Paper Writing Protocol §2.1\n    title_minimality:\n      authority: Paper Writing Protocol §2.1\n      hard_character_limit: false\n    hard_grammar_rule: false\n", "  professional_heading_semantics:\n    governance_level: default\n    reader_assumption: mathematical_modeling_literate_not_domain_specialist\n    principle: >-\n      标题按独立数学任务划分。默认评委具有数学建模基础，但不预设其熟悉题目所属行业、专业物理概念或算法缩写；\n      标题优先让评委先恢复“处理哪个对象、回答什么问题或完成什么计算任务”，再由正文准确介绍模型、机制和方法。\n    judge_recoverability_rule: >-\n      标题脱离作者内部上下文后仍应能定位当前对象与任务。若标题只剩领域术语、算法缩写或多个方法名串联，\n      使非该领域评委无法判断本节在解决什么，应补回对象/任务，或把非必要方法名移到节首正文解释。\n    method_name_rule: >-\n      标准模型名、方法名和必要专业术语可以保留；当它们承担区分不同任务、说明真实核心方法或避免歧义时不应强删。\n      “评委可理解”不等于把准确术语改成泛化口语，也不要求所有标题都写成同一种句式。\n    cumcm_heading_level_precedence:\n      scope: cumcm_question_establishment_solution_subsections\n      second_level_default_authority: model_establishment_solution_narrative.within_question_subsection_architecture.cumcm_default_second_level\n      second_level_role: >-\n        常规复杂问的二级标题为非领域评委提供稳定的建模、求解、结果与分析及可选检验导航；\n        优先保留规范原文和数学依赖顺序，不因为 Heading Compression、算法名称或“更专业”任意改写。\n      third_level_role: >-\n        三级标题才重点回答“本节对什么对象完成了哪项具体数学任务”，\n        不以算法缩写、物理领域术语或多个方法名称堆叠代替任务说明。\n      readability_primary_target: third_level_heading\n      second_level_exception_boundary: >-\n        简单解析任务无独立求解、后问仅有真实增量、多独立模型难以用正常结构表示，\n        或实际数学依赖与官方模板发生冲突时，才可解释理由后调整二级；\n        “更简短”“避免重复”“展示算法名”不是充分例外。\n      heading_compression_scope: >-\n        CUMCM 问题章节的 Judge Readability 与 Heading Compression 重点应用于三级标题，\n        不把标题压缩测试用来删除正常二级的建模、求解、结果分析或有效检验功能。\n      mathematical_accuracy_invariant: >-\n        三级标题保留对数学正确性与不同任务区分必要的专业术语；\n        不为了通俗而把明确的对象、判据和边界写成“模型处理”“数据处理”“结果说明”。\n    preferred_pattern: object_plus_mathematical_task\n    alternative_patterns:\n      - method_plus_current_task\n      - result_or_parameter_plus_validation_task\n    action_examples: [确定, 表征, 构造, 推导, 判定, 离散, 降维, 分解, 转化, 估计, 求解, 搜索, 优化, 校准, 验证, 比较]\n    generic_heading_review_examples: [模型分析, 模型处理, 参数处理, 算法设计, 结果说明]\n    title_minimality:\n      principle: >-\n        标题只保留识别当前数学对象和任务所需的信息；父标题已经提供的“问题X、模型建立与求解、优化模型”等上下文默认不重复。\n      cumcm_scope_boundary: >-\n        对 CUMCM 问题章节重点优化三级标题；正常复杂问的二级标题先服从规范功能导航，\n        不因父标题重复或字号/长度偏好而改写，除非有真实数学或官方格式例外。\n      heading_compression_test: >-\n        删除上位研究背景、问题编号上下文或“基于/视角下/研究”等包装后，若当前数学任务仍完整，应优先采用压缩后的标题。\n      avoid:\n        - parent_context_repetition\n        - research_framing_repetition\n        - decorative_based_on_or_perspective_of\n        - generic_method_stacking\n        - jargon_or_acronym_only_when_object_is_hidden\n        - title_as_full_sentence_without_navigation_gain\n      hard_character_limit: false\n    rules:\n      - 决策变量、目标函数、约束与核心模型汇总若只是同一短模型建立链，默认连续组织，不机械拆成多个三级标题。\n      - 若决策变量、目标函数、关键约束或模型汇总本身包含独立公式组、非平凡定义或后文需要明确回指的任务，可使用清晰短标题；不得为“连续叙事”强行合并。\n      - 一个公式、一张表或一个参数设置本身不自动构成独立标题。\n      - 仅由专业缩写、领域名词或多个算法名称串联构成的标题，若遮蔽研究对象和当前任务，应改为对象/任务优先的标题，并在正文准确保留方法名。\n      - “数据处理”“模型处理”“结果说明”“影响因素”等无对象泛化标题不能因为更通俗而替代更准确的任务标题。\n      - 短名词标题若能准确恢复数学任务可以保留，不强制“XX的XX”或“名词+动词”语法。\n    hard_grammar_rule: false\n"),
        ("problem_background:\n  authority: modules/05_writing/paper_writing_protocol.md#6.1-问题重述\n\nmodel_evaluation:\n  authority: modules/05_writing/paper_writing_protocol.md#15-模型评价逐问结论与附录\n\n", "problem_background:\n  governance_level: recommendation\n  default: one_paragraph\n  allow_second_short_paragraph_when: reality_background_to_specific_research_object_needs_semantic_narrowing\n  second_paragraph_must: narrow_object_or_core_conflict\n  forbidden_second_paragraph: document_structure_or_chapter_management_only\n\nmodel_evaluation:\n  governance_level: recommendation\n  strengths_typical: [2, 4]\n  strengths_usual_target: 3\n  weaknesses_typical: [1, 2]\n  count_relation_required: false\n  concise_transfer_rule: 仅在确有迁移对象时简述可继承的结构、需要重新标定的参数或约束和适用边界，避免空泛应用罗列。\n  rule: 优点结合真实模型结构与求解性质，局限说明受影响的结果及范围；数量按实际模型决定，不检查“优点必须多于缺点”，也不机械增加推广小节。\n\n"),
        ("  anti_template_boundary:\n    - 正文避免无必要地连续重复句式；摘要已规定的固定句式除外。\n\n", "  anti_template_boundary:\n    - 不从单一优秀论文复制固定句式、算法名、章节编号或题目专属模型。\n    - 不要求所有论文设置“模型准备”、问题关系图、命题、核心模型汇总独立小节、正式算法框或统一敏感性章节。\n    - 不按固定标题数量判定论文质量；章节层级由当前论证链和真实数学结构决定。\n    - 不把“承接—建式—解释—求解—结果”固化为固定句型或固定标题；规则只抽象逻辑功能。\n    - 规则只抽象可跨题型复用的推理结构，具体章节和证据按当前赛题决定。\n\n"),
        ("  anti_template_boundary:\n    - 见 scope.anti_template_boundary。\n", "  anti_template_boundary:\n    - 不复制任何优秀论文的固定句子、章节编号、算法或题目专属建模顺序。\n    - 不要求每个公式前出现同一承接词，不要求每段固定使用“因此/进一步/从而”。\n    - 不固定三级标题数量、流程图数量、Step 1--n、模型建立末尾总结句或图表分析三句式。\n    - 不把PSO、GA、DE、二分法、坐标搜索或任何参考论文算法设为默认 solver。\n    - 不把机理题中的某一对象顺序推广成统计、预测、网络、仿真或机器学习题的固定模板。\n    - 不把 Figure Result Narrative 固化为“图身份—特征—数值—原因—结论”的固定句数或固定措辞。\n    - 不把“模型适用性”固化为每问独立小节；适用理由优先贴近模型或 solver 首次出现处。\n    - 不把局部求解依赖升级为全文大章节重排规则。\n"),
        ("  prose_target:\n    analysis_sentence_should_add_one_of:\n", "  prose_target:\n    preferred_subjects:\n      - current_object\n      - current_relation\n      - current_condition\n      - current_result\n      - current_mathematical_task\n    reduce_repeated_subjects: [本文, 本问, 该模型, 我们]\n    analysis_sentence_should_add_one_of:\n"),
        ("      作者表达按 Paper Writing Protocol §7.3 执行。", "      reduce_repeated_subjects 只针对机械重复的步骤宣告，不是第一人称禁令；\n      有信息的作者视角及其表达边界按 Paper Writing Protocol §7.3 执行。"),
        ("    subject_roles:\n      quota: none\n      rule: 见 Paper Writing Protocol §7.3.2。\n", "    subject_roles:\n      author_we: local_reasoning_action\n      paper_this_work: paper_scope_or_contribution\n      object_subject: established_mathematical_or_empirical_fact\n      quota: none\n      rule: >-\n        “我们”“本文”与对象/结果主语都可合法使用；按当前语义功能自然选择，\n        不批量互换，也不因正式性偏好统一成某一主语。\n"),
        ("    prohibit:\n      - pronoun_frequency_target", "    necessity_tests:\n      - reasoning_necessity\n      - problem_specificity\n    necessity_rule: >-\n      删除作者声音句后若不丢失选择理由、当前缺口、数学作用、验证目标或结论边界，应压缩、换主语或删除；\n      若替换研究对象后句子仍可原样用于任意赛题，应优先回到当前机制、数据、约束或评价目标重写。\n    prohibit:\n      - pronoun_frequency_target"),
        ("        - terminology_drift_check\n        - paragraph_necessity_check\n", "        - terminology_drift_check\n        - caption_length_check\n        - paragraph_necessity_check\n"),
        ("    may_warn:\n      - generic_algorithm_exposition_without_local_variable_or_constraint_terms\n      - repeated_result_number_sentence\n    must_not_do:\n", "    may_warn:\n      - highly_similar_adjacent_paragraphs\n      - generic_algorithm_exposition_without_local_variable_or_constraint_terms\n      - repeated_result_number_sentence\n      - repeated_meta_summary\n    must_not_do:\n"),
        ("machine_audit_boundary:\n  report_only_for_semantic_style_risks: true\n  may_warn:\n    - dense_formula_blocks_with_little_prose\n    - repeated_cross_question_redefinition\n    - unexplained_numeric_parameter_assignment\n    - unused_bibliography_entry\n    - terminology_drift\n    - numeric_style_drift\n    - unreferenced_label_or_equation\n    - raw_python_like_pseudocode\n    - management_transition\n  may_review:\n", "machine_audit_boundary:\n  report_only_for_semantic_style_risks: true\n  may_warn:\n    - dense_formula_blocks_with_little_prose\n    - repeated_further_obtain_or_similarly_obtain\n    - repeated_meta_navigation\n    - repeated_cross_question_redefinition\n    - unexplained_numeric_parameter_assignment\n    - repeated_identical_question_opening_pattern\n    - unused_bibliography_entry\n    - terminology_drift\n    - numeric_style_drift\n    - unreferenced_label_or_equation\n    - unusually_long_caption\n    - paragraph_redundancy_risk\n    - raw_python_like_pseudocode\n    - management_transition\n  may_review:\n"),
